### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Test 1: Evaluate LOW RISK Action (AUTONOMOUS)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/actions/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agent_id": "agent-001",
  "operation": "read",
  "target_table": "customers",
  "condition": "id = 10",
  "record_count": 1,
  "data_category": "customer",
  "llm_confidence": 0.9,
  "validation_score": 0.9,
  "parameters": {}
}

### Test 2: Evaluate MEDIUM RISK Action (CONFIRM)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/actions/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agent_id": "agent-002",
  "operation": "update",
  "target_table": "customers",
  "condition": "id = 10",
  "record_count": 1,
  "data_category": "customer",
  "llm_confidence": 0.8,
  "validation_score": 0.8,
  "parameters": {
    "set": {"email": "new@email.com"}
  }
}

### Test 3: Evaluate HIGH RISK Action (REVIEW)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/actions/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agent_id": "agent-003",
  "operation": "bulk_delete",
  "target_table": "customers",
  "condition": "country = 'India'",
  "record_count": 10000,
  "data_category": "customer",
  "llm_confidence": 0.3,
  "validation_score": 0.3,
  "parameters": {}
}

### Test 4: View Pending Confirmations
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/actions/pending-confirmations

### Test 5: View Pending Reviews
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/reviews/pending

### Test 6: View Audit Logs
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit?limit=10